  "principles": [
    "Contribution is a sect-wide institutional currency, but each department fulfills only its own authorized goods/services.",
    "Public stone purchases cover generic, non-sensitive or personal equipment; they do not require sect contribution.",
    "Starting issue, origin-only, mission rewards and exploration uniques are not sold.",
    "Mission-unlock redemptions remain contribution goods after the relevant narrative authorization.",
    "Dual-currency equipment is minimized: each piece should have one primary economy unless a material-service route is explicitly intended.",
    "Contribution should buy access/specialization, not merely a discount on public goods.",
    "Public gear remains viable but should not dominate the strongest institutional identity pieces at the same stage."
  ],
